## Features to build (full set)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Storefront (brand-first — the anti-marketplace advantage)
Landing (hero, value prop, above-the-fold Book CTA), **DB-driven** services catalog with
photos/price-range/duration/prep+care notes, portfolio gallery (filter by style/length,
before/after), about, testimonials/reviews (live from DB), FAQ, location + accurate
embedded map + hours, contact form (actually sends), social/Instagram. SEO + a11y first.

### Booking engine (the core loop — must be flawless on mobile)
Guest-friendly, **no forced account**, ≤3-tap path, visible progress bar, full price +
deposit shown up front:
1. Style family → service → size/length variant (dynamic price + **duration**).
2. Duration-aware, conflict-safe availability calendar (recurring hours + overrides +
   buffer; grays out taken slots; suggests next opening). Fixes v1's fixed-240-min bug.
3. Intake/consultation form with **real inspiration-photo upload** to Supabase Storage
   (scalp sensitivity, prior damage, hair length/type, allergies, reference photos,
   photo-usage consent).
4. **Deposit checkout** with Stripe Payment Elements (Apple/Google Pay), tax included;
   creates a slot hold first, then PaymentIntent; consented cancellation policy checkbox.
5. On success → appointment **pending** + instant confirmation email/SMS; NOT auto-confirmed.

### No-show protection engine (highest-priority research finding)
- Per-service deposit (flat or %), non-refundable, auto-applied to final price; option to
  exempt trusted returning clients.
- Consented cancellation policy at booking (checkbox + stored timestamp) → makes fees
  defensible. Card-on-file no-show / late-cancel fee, stackable on the deposit.
- Enforceable self-service reschedule/cancel windows (e.g. free >48h, deposit forfeit <24h).

### Client experience
Optional account (magic-link, auto-created on email at booking), upcoming + past
appointments, self-service reschedule/cancel within policy, booking history, rebook in
one tap, saved profile.

### Admin dashboard (real server auth + roles)
**Catalog management (full CRUD):** create/rename/delete **categories**; create a service
inside a category; edit a service (name, category, duration, buffer, base price, flat
deposit, deposit toggle, tax rate, prep/care notes, image, active); delete a service; manage
its **size/length/add-on tiers**. Backed by `service_categories` + `services` +
`service_tiers`, all mutations via authenticated admin APIs (never client-trusted).

**Calendar management:** day/agenda view color-coded by status; **block a slot / day**
(availability override / blackout); edit weekly hours + buffers; **create an appointment
directly on the calendar** (walk-in / phone booking — pick or create client, choose service,
record deposit as paid-in-person, no online charge; overlap-guarded by the same EXCLUDE
constraint). Charge the $20 blow-dry / $20 late fees in person from the appointment card.

Plus: **pending-approval queue**, booking management
(confirm/decline/complete/no_show/cancel/revert), **client CRM** (profile,
notes, preferences, allergies flagged, style photos, lifetime spend, tags VIP/returning),
reviews (moderate + reply + auto-request post-appointment), finance (deposits collected,
balances owed, refunds, revenue by period counting only *completed*, tax-ready CSV
export), messaging, analytics (bookings/month, revenue, top styles, utilization,
no-show rate, new vs returning).

### Growth / retention (research-driven, built-in, never a paywalled upsell)
- Auto-filling **waitlist**: client self-joins with date flexibility; freed slots
  auto-notify best matches.
- **Automated rebooking** prompt at checkout + timed follow-up on the 6–8 week braid cycle.
- **Auto review request** shortly after completion; reviews feed storefront social proof.
- Lightweight retention: lapsed-client win-back + one-tap message blast (kept minimal).

### System
Supabase Auth (client + admin roles via `stylists.user_id`), RLS everywhere (no `using(true)`
on PII), transactional email + SMS (idempotent), Stripe webhooks (signed + idempotent,
verify amount), Supabase Storage for images + optimization, SEO (per-page metadata,
metadataBase, OG/Twitter, canonical, robots, sitemap, LocalBusiness/HairSalon JSON-LD),
accessibility (WCAG: focus trap, aria-expanded, contrast, labelled controls), privacy/
cookie policy.

